{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09191","headline":"酬李儋 · 韦应物","name":"酬李儋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开门临广陌，旭旦车驾喧。\n不见同心友，徘徊忧且烦。\n都城二十里，居在艮与坤。\n人生所各务，乖阔累朝昏。\n湛湛罇中酒，青青芳树园。\n缄情未及发，先此枉璵璠。\n迈世超高躅，寻流得真源。\n明当策疲马，与子同笑言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}